PARITY_COVERED=24

i18n: every visible literal resolves through the ILocalizer facade with the web key
names; all twelve required keys are resolved up front in the projection (so they are
requested in BOTH the empty and success states) — ChargingHeatmapPageTests asserts
this via a RecordingLocalizer in both states.
units: SI read directly from the API (total_energy_added_wh stays watt-hours on the
model); display scaling (÷1000 → kWh via UnitConverters.EnergyFromSi) happens only in
the projection / stats reduction at the render boundary, mirroring the web's
convertEnergyFromSI(wh,'kWh'). The 7×24 grid bins each session by its start instant in
the display TimeZoneInfo (web browser-local new Date(...).getDay()/.getHours()).

